flowchart TD
    SearchStart([生命周期入口]) --> SearchLock[获取全局 APM 锁]
    SearchLock -->|失败| SearchLockFail[打印锁错误] --> SearchExitError([释放锁并非零退出])
    SearchLock -->|成功| SearchJournal{存在未完成 journal?}
    SearchJournal -->|检查失败| SearchJournalFail[打印 journal 检查错误] --> SearchExitError
    SearchJournal -->|否| SearchCommand[进入当前命令]
    SearchJournal -->|是| SearchDecide{根据阶段与路径状态判断提交点}
    SearchDecide -->|提交点前| SearchRepairRollback[回滚上次事务]
    SearchDecide -->|提交点后| SearchRepairCommit[完成上次事务提交]
    SearchRepairRollback --> SearchRepairResult{修复成功?}
    SearchRepairCommit --> SearchRepairResult
    SearchRepairResult -->|否| SearchRepairFail[保留 journal 并打印修复失败] --> SearchExitError
    SearchRepairResult -->|是| SearchRepairLog[打印回滚或提交及修复内容] --> SearchCommand
    SearchRepairRollback -.进程中断.-> SearchInterrupted([内核释放锁；下次命令重新预检])
    SearchRepairCommit -.进程中断.-> SearchInterrupted
    SearchJournal -.进程中断.-> SearchInterrupted

    SearchCommand --> SearchValidate[校验必填 keyword、agent 与 type]
    SearchValidate -->|失败| SearchFail[打印参数或 Agent/Adapter 错误] --> SearchExitError
    SearchValidate -->|成功| SearchCloudSearch[调用云端列表接口并按 keyword 及 flags 过滤]
    SearchCloudSearch -->|请求或解析失败| SearchFail
    SearchCloudSearch -->|成功| SearchPrint[打印匹配的云端 Power]
    SearchPrint --> SearchExitOK([释放锁并正常退出])
    SearchValidate -.进程中断.-> SearchInterrupted
    SearchCloudSearch -.进程中断.-> SearchInterrupted
    SearchPrint -.进程中断.-> SearchInterrupted
